# {{senseid|en|Q132033}}{{lb|en|geology}} A [[supercontinent]] which included most of the [[landmass]]es which make up today's continents of the [[Northern Hemisphere]].
#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Asher Elbein|title=This Dinosaur Found in Chile Had a Battle Ax for a Tail|work=The New York Times|date=2021-12-01|url=https://www.nytimes.com/2021/12/01/science/dinosaur-tail-weapon.html|issn=0362-4331|passage=A diverse collection of ankylosaurs once roamed in great numbers across '''Laurasia''' — the northern supercontinent that once contained North America and Asia.}}

